+/audit-output/evidence/k/verification-body-mutant.k changes the actual executed
+function body from sum(q) <= w to sum(q) < w. The companion original-contract
+claim remains sum <= w in /audit-output/evidence/k/spec-body-mutant.k.
+
+COMMAND: kompile verification-body-mutant.k --backend haskell --main-module VERIFICATION-BODY-MUTANT --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX --output-definition body-mutant-kompiled
+WORKDIR: /tmp/audit-work/reconstruction
+EXIT: 0
+BOUNDED OUTPUT:
+Build succeeded. Only the fixed str.k unused-variable warnings were emitted.
+
+COMMAND: kprove spec-body-mutant.k --definition body-mutant-kompiled --spec-module SPEC-BODY-MUTANT
+WORKDIR: /tmp/audit-work/reconstruction
+EXIT: 1
+RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+Warning (WarnStuckClaimState):
+The configuration's term unifies with the destination's term, but the
+implication check between the conditions has failed.
+#Not ( {
+  true
+#Equals
+  mutantSumIntVS ( VS ) <Int W
+} )
+<k>
+  mutantSumIntVS ( VS ) <Int W ~> .K
+</k>
+...
+true #Equals mutantSumIntVS ( VS ) <=Int W
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
